---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-rule">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
		{/*
			The copyright line names Simon Engel, not Asia Society Switzerland.
			The project was created for them, which the about page says, but that
			is not the same as them holding the rights, and asserting it in a
			copyright notice was a licensing problem.
		*/}
		<p class="text-xs text-mist">
			&copy; {year} Simon Engel. Asia Pours is an editorial project, not a commercial product.
		</p>
		<nav aria-label="Footer">
			<ul class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
				<li>
					<a href="/sources" class="font-label text-xs text-ash hover:text-brass transition-colors">
						Sources
					</a>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="/about" class="font-label text-xs text-ash hover:text-brass transition-colors">
						AI disclosure
					</a>
				</li>
				{/*
					§ 5 DDG requires the Impressum to be reachable from every page
					in no more than two clicks, so it lives in the global footer.
				*/}
				<li>
					<a href="/impressum" class="font-label text-xs text-ash hover:text-brass transition-colors">
						Impressum
					</a>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</nav>
	</div>
</footer>
